  data: {
    LLM: "Get rid of your lowest cards (3s, 4s, 5s) early by leading them when you have control. Save your 2s to regain the lead when opponents play their high cards.\n\nCombination Management: If you have a single 2 and a pair of 2s, don't waste the pair on a single lead. Wait for someone to play a high pair to trap them.\n\nCard Counting: There are only four 2s and four Aces. Once they are played, the Kings become the most powerful cards. Track them to know when your 'medium' cards are guaranteed to win the lead.",
    Player: "Get rid of your lowest cards (3s, 4s, 5s) early by leading them when you have control. Save your 2s to regain the lead when opponents play their high cards.\n\nCombination Management: If you have a single 2 and a pair of 2s, don't waste the pair on a single lead. Wait for someone to play a high pair to trap them.\n\nCard Counting: There are only four 2s and four Aces. Once they are played, the Kings become the most powerful cards. Track them to know when your 'medium' cards are guaranteed to win the lead.",
